WEBVTT

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.684
to share their ideas in Arabic.

00:00:31.403 --> 00:00:34.209
We actually have 
many TED Talks on our sites

00:00:34.209 --> 00:00:36.219
translated and subtitled into Arabic,

00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:40.479
and there have been many TEDx events
all across the Arab world.

00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:43.215
But this is the first TED initiative

00:00:43.215 --> 00:00:46.755
specifically focused 
on the Arabic language.

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.185
We are going to discuss that,

00:00:48.185 --> 00:00:51.425
and we are going to discuss 
the future of education, and more.

00:00:51.425 --> 00:00:53.635
Dr. Hasnah, welcome. How are you?

00:00:54.266 --> 00:00:55.676
I'm fine, thank you, Bruno.

00:00:55.676 --> 00:00:59.190
It's a pleasure being with you 
and with the TED community.